@startuml
participant Checkout
participant Orders
database Database
participant Publisher
queue Broker
participant Fulfilment
Checkout -> Orders: POST /v1/orders + key
Orders -> Orders: Validate and authenticate
Orders -> Database: Transaction: order + key + outbox
Database --> Orders: Commit
Orders --> Checkout: 201 accepted
Publisher -> Database: Read pending outbox
Publisher -> Broker: order.accepted.v1
Broker --> Publisher: Acknowledge
Publisher -> Database: Mark delivered
Broker -> Fulfilment: Event (may be redelivered)
Fulfilment -> Fulfilment: Commit duplicate marker + local work
Fulfilment --> Broker: Acknowledge
@enduml
